  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Urban Water Sector Reform Project 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s principal development objectives are to improve reliability and financial viability of selected urban water utilitiescomma and to increase access to piped water networks in selected urban areas. Progress toward these principal development outcomes will be measured through i) the increase in water delivered through existing and extended networks; ii) improvements in cost recoverycomma and iii) increase in the number of household connections to the piped water network.</narrative>
  </description>
